Hi all,

I have a quick question about the pairwise p-values from the advanced.procD.lm function. Are these values corrected for multiple comparisons? I wasn't able to find anything about this in the documentation. I assume this would be necessary to avoid erroneous inference of significance.

Thanks,

Dan MacGuigan

From u4d71c6e24fb21497 at groups.google.com  Fri Jan 11 16:15:02 2019
From: u4d71c6e24fb21497 at groups.google.com (Adams, Dean [EEOBS])
Date: Fri, 11 Jan 2019 16:15:02 +0000
