Brittany,

In your code you performed a GPA superimposition, and placed the output in ‘myData.super’.  But then, your plot of specimens using plotTangentSpace called your original data, not the superimposed data.

A more careful reading of the help files of geomorph, and some additional familiarity with R, will assist in these issues. I suggest you begin there. Geomorph’s help files are rather extensive and laden with many examples: including for what you are attempting to do.

