Hey guys,

What determines the tolerance value (Q) in the convergence computation using partial Procrustes superimposition? Is it an arbitrary number? I learned that 'Morpho' provides an option to alter this quantity: procSym (tol = ) and if I have understood this correctly, then this is apparently critical when dealing with an increasing number of sliding semi landmarks.

Cheers,

Mohamad

