You are not specifying the components correctly, so the function will not work.

A more careful reading of the help files will make this clear. The output from gpagen is a list that contains various components. In plotTangentSpace you need to specify the coordinates to be used, which in your case are found in:  ‘myData.super$coords’

Again, a careful reading of the help files and the examples they provide, will make this clear.

