Hi Mike

Thanks for your careful consideration of this issue.

To answer your question - I am not sure what you mean by 'fitted values' in this particular context, but what I did in SAS was:
1) calculate centroids for each ontogenetic stage within each species
3) performed a PCA on the centroids
4) projected centroids and original data AFTER mean-centering this combined data set

Hope this helps.

Thanks,

Karen

